{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And they cast.</b> This is the second wonder: the staff of Aaron swallowed the staffs of the sorcerers and they were not found, and they called it 'the staff of Aaron' because so it was at the beginning. And R. Yeshuah said: after it returned, it swallowed their staffs — and this is a great wonder."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:20.951736972Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}